  "space": {
    "$type": "dimension",
    "$description": "ONE normative spacing scale, rem on a 16px base — v1.9 --vd-space-fib-*, 9/9 match. Names are Fibonacci numbers. Values <= 12px follow registered exception C-01 (rem-rounded 2/4/6/8/12); literal from 13px. v1.9 also ships --vd-spacing-* (literal Fibonacci px — same values in px) and --vd-space-* (4px-based conventional utility scale, class B); both are aliases, not parallel systems.",
